---
title: Layout 4 - Minimalist Single-Column
layout: base
---

{# Layout 4: Minimalist Single-Column Design #}
<div class="release-layout-4">
    <div class="minimal-container">
        
        <header class="minimal-header">
            <div class="release-number">{{ project_number or "03" }}</div>
            <h1 class="minimal-title">{{ title or "release title" }}</h1>
            {% if collaborators %}
            <p class="minimal-collab">{{ collaborators }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </header>

        <section class="artwork-section">
            <div class="artwork-container">
                <img src="{{ img or '/assets/images/releases/placeholder.jpg' }}" alt="{{ title }} cover" class="minimal-artwork" sizes="(max-width: 480px) 200px, (max-width: 768px) 250px, 300px">
                {% if necklace %}
                <div class="physical-note">+ physical edition</div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">type</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ release_type or "ep" }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">released</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ date or "jun 2025" }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">duration</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ length or "3:42" }}</span>
                </div>
                {% if track_count and track_count > 1 %}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">tracks</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ track_count }}</span>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="description-section">
            <p class="minimal-description">{{ description or "ethereal melodies meet digital decay in this introspective journey through modern loneliness" }}</p>
        </section>

        <section class="streaming-section">
            <div class="stream-links">
                <a href="{{ spotify_link or '#' }}" class="minimal-link">spotify</a>
                <a href="{{ apple_link or '#' }}" class="minimal-link">apple music</a>
                <a href="{{ release_link or '#' }}" class="minimal-link">all platforms</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="detailed-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">about</h2>
            <div class="content-block">
                <p>{{ detailed_description or "born from late-night sessions in a converted basement studio, this release captures the liminal space between connection and isolation. each track explores different facets of digital-age relationships, where genuine emotion gets compressed into data streams." }}</p>
                <p>{{ additional_description or "the sound palette draws from early 2000s electronica while incorporating contemporary production techniques. there's a deliberate sparseness here—every element feels necessary, purposeful. the result is something that breathes, where silence carries as much weight as sound." }}</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="lyrics-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">lyrics</h2>
            <div class="lyrics-container">
                
                <div class="verse-group">
                    <div class="verse-lines">
                        <div class="lyric-line">walking through the static noise</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">finding fragments of your voice</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">between the pixels and the pain</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">nothing here will feel the same</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="verse-meaning">
                        <p>digital interference becomes a metaphor for communication breakdown. memories become data artifacts—preserved but degraded.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="verse-group">
                    <div class="verse-lines">
                        <div class="lyric-line">scrolling through the endless feed</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">looking for what i might need</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">but all i find are empty screens</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">reflecting back my hollow dreams</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="verse-meaning">
                        <p>the endless scroll as a metaphor for seeking connection in digital spaces. the mirror effect of social media reflecting our own emptiness back at us.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="verse-group">
                    <div class="verse-lines">
                        <div class="lyric-line">in this space between the code</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">where human hearts decompose</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">i'm learning how to feel again</div>
                        <div class="lyric-line">beyond what algorithms send</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="verse-meaning">
                        <p>the possibility of transcending algorithmic mediation to find genuine feeling. hope emerges from recognizing the limitations of digital connection.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="process-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">process</h2>
            <div class="process-content">
                
                <div class="process-block">
                    <h3 class="process-step">writing</h3>
                    <p>{{ writing_process or "initial ideas captured during 3am walks with nothing but a phone voice recorder. most lyrics emerged from stream-of-consciousness sessions, later refined for clarity while preserving the raw emotional core." }}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="process-block">
                    <h3 class="process-step">recording</h3>
                    <p>{{ recording_process or "all tracking done in a converted basement space over three months. primary setup: neumann u67 → neve 1073 → universal audio 1176. the concrete walls provided natural reverb that became integral to the sound." }}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="process-block">
                    <h3 class="process-step">production</h3>
                    <p>{{ production_process or "philosophy of subtraction—every element had to justify its existence. extensive use of analog processing before digital conversion. final mixes printed to 1/4\" tape for additional warmth and compression." }}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="media-section">
                    <div class="process-images">
                        <figure class="process-figure">
                            <img src="{{ studio_image_1 or '/assets/images/placeholder-studio.jpg' }}" alt="Studio setup" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 150px">
                            <figcaption>basement studio setup</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <figure class="process-figure">
                            <img src="{{ studio_image_2 or '/assets/images/placeholder-gear.jpg' }}" alt="Recording chain" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 150px">
                            <figcaption>primary recording chain</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <figure class="process-figure">
                            <img src="{{ studio_image_3 or '/assets/images/placeholder-mixing.jpg' }}" alt="Mixing setup" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 150px">
                            <figcaption>mixing environment</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>

<style>
